  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p>For more information and to order stereo imagery products, please refer to the&nbsp;<a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/GEO-Stereo-Imagery-Order-Form.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>GEO Stereo Imagery Order Form</a>.</p><div><ul><li>Time of Capture: April 28th - June 7th, 2014</li><li>Number of Images: 329 lines&nbsp;</li><li>Resolution: 18 centimetre (RGBN)</li><li>Bit-depth: 16-bit&nbsp;</li><li>Number of bands: Four band (RGBN)&nbsp;</li><li>Format: TIFF (SocetSet model setup)&nbsp;</li><li>Camera(s): Leica ADS100 line based</li></ul><p>For more information on the&nbsp;<span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>Digital Raster Acquisition Project Eastern Ontario (DRAPE</span>) 2014 please see the&nbsp;<a target='_blank' href='https://geohub.lio.gov.on.ca/datasets/lio::digital-raster-acquisition-project-eastern-ontario-drape-2014-1km-index/about' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>main DRAPE 2014 GeoHub record.</a>&nbsp;</p></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Available Products:&nbsp;</strong></div><div>Stereo Lines&nbsp;</div><div><ul><li><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>Digital Raster Acquisition Project Eastern Ontario (DRAPE</span>) 2014&nbsp;- Stereo Lines and associated Models&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Contact Ontario Ministry of Natural Resources - Geospatial Ontario,&nbsp;<a href='mailto:imagery@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>imagery@ontario.ca</a></p></div>"
